    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GVM are delighted to introduce to the market this charming two-bedroom mid-terraced residence, superbly positioned within approximately a 15-minute walk of Limerick City Centre.\n\nThis compact and conveniently located home offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation together with off-street parking and a particularly generous rear garden. \n\nThe garden provides excellent scope for an extension or further development, subject to any necessary planning permission.\n\nThe accommodation opens into a tiled entrance hall leading to a bright sitting room overlooking the front garden and driveway. This comfortable reception room features laminate flooring, a feature fireplace and a built-in display area.\n\nTo the rear is a fitted kitchen with a selection of floor and eye-level units, tiled flooring and wall tiling. A window overlooking the substantial rear garden and patio area brings plenty of natural light into the space. A tiled rear porch provides access to the garden and incorporates a guest WC with wash-hand basin.\n\nUpstairs are two bedrooms. The spacious main bedroom is a double room with laminate flooring, built-in wardrobes and additional storage, while the second bedroom is also finished with laminate flooring.\nFurther benefits include gas-fired central heating, uPVC double-glazed windows, wrought-iron entrance gates and off-street parking.\n\nWith public transport available nearby and Limerick`s central business and retail districts within comfortable walking distance, this property represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, those seeking to downsize or investors looking for a well-located city home.\n\nInspection is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\n\n\nEntrance Hall 2.3m x 1.2m - \nEntered through a uPVC front door and finished with tiled flooring.\n\nSitting Room 4.3m x 3.2m - \nBright and spacious reception room overlooking the front garden and driveway. Laminate flooring, feature fireplace, radiator and built-in display area.\n\nKitchen 2.5m x 2.4m\n - Fitted floor and eye-level units, tiled flooring, wall tiling and a window overlooking the rear garden and patio area.\n\nRear Porch 5.0m x 0.8m\n - Tiled flooring and a door providing access to the rear garden.\n\nGuest WC 3.0m x 1.0m - \nWC and wash-hand basin.\n\nFirst Floor \n\nBedroom One 4.2m x 3.3m - \nSpacious double bedroom overlooking the front garden, with laminate flooring, built-in wardrobes and storage.\n\nBedroom Two 4.3m x 2.4m - Single bedroom with laminate flooring.\n\nKey \n\nFeatures\n\n- Convenient location within approximately a 15-minute walk of Limerick City Centre\n-\nTwo well-proportioned bedrooms\nSubstantial rear garden and patio area\n-\nExcellent potential to extend or develop, subject to planning permission\n\n-Off-street parking\nWrought-iron entrance gates\n-\nGas-fired central heating\nu\n-PVC double-glazed windows\n-\nPublic transport nearby\n-\nIdeal for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors\n\n-Attractive price point\nInspection highly recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: F<br>Energy Performance Indicator: 350 kWh/m2/yr"
