      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Limerick City Centre, proceed along William Street and continue onto Mulgrave Street. At the junction with Roxboro Road, turn right and continue straight before turning left onto Kilmallock Road. Proceed for a short distance and Bengal Terrace will be located on the right-hand side. No. 24 will be identified by a GVM `For Sale` sign."
      },
